exports[`S1 This week > en > normal: renders, keeps the count contract, no identity 1`] = `"<div data-testid="layout"><div data-testid="insights-this-week" class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-xl flex-col text-[#1d2025]"><header class="flex flex-col gap-3 px-1 pb-1.5 pt-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><h1 class="min-w-0 flex-1 break-words text-[32px] font-light leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.015em] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">This week</h1></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span data-testid="s1-today" class="inline-flex h-[30px] items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white px-3 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#4b5563]"><span data-date="2026-10-26">Mon 26 Oct</span></span></div></header><div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 pb-4 pt-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 pb-2"><section data-testid="s1-note" data-note="00000000-0000-4000-8000-060000000001" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-[#eef2ff] px-4 py-3.5 text-[#312e81]"><p class="text-[11.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] rtl:tracking-normal">From your RM</p><ul data-text="note" class="flex list-none flex-col gap-1 text-[15px] leading-snug [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><li>This month "Ran out of time" shows most at Govt. Primary School Fictional-03.</li><li>Please run "Peer observation with one look-for: the minute the explanation ended" there before 30 Oct.</li><li>Bring the moment to the Friday circle.</li></ul><p class="text-[13px] text-[#4338ca]">by <span data-date="2026-10-30">Fri 30 Oct</span></p><div class="flex gap-2"><a data-testid="s1-note-open" class="flex min-h-[44px] flex-1 items-center justify-center rounded-xl px-3 text-[15px] font-semibold bg-[#4f46e5] text-white" href="/portal/coach/insights/w/W-IP-TIME">Open the move</a><button type="button" data-testid="s1-note-dismiss" class="flex min-h-[44px] flex-1 items-center justify-center rounded-xl px-3 text-[15px] font-semibold border border-[#c7d2fe] bg-white text-[#312e81]">Done</button></div></section><div data-testid="wcard" data-w="W-IP-TIME"><section class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white px-4 py-3.5 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(16,24,40,0.05)] "><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="text-[11.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#47BA7D] rtl:tracking-normal">NOTICE</p><span data-nonum="" class="rounded-full bg-[#f3f4f6] px-2.5 py-1 text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[#374151]">Move 1 of 2</span></div><p class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span data-num="17" data-den="49" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="text-[34px] font-bold leading-none tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#1d2025]">17 of 49</span><span class="text-[18px] font-medium leading-snug text-[#1d2025]">lessons whose plan asked for independent practice ran out of time before the practice.</span></p><p class="text-[14.5px] leading-snug text-[#374151]"><span data-stat="median" data-base="17" data-win="w4-2026-09-28">In the lessons that ran out of time, the explanation ran a median of about 6 minutes over the plan.</span> <span data-num="7" data-den="17" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">7 of these also ended before the closing check.</span></p><p data-window="w4-2026-09-28" class="text-[12.5px] leading-snug text-[#6b7280]">28 Sep to 25 Oct · lesson-plan fidelity · scoring changed 28 Sep</p><p data-testid="wcard-where" class="text-[15px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1d2025] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-03</span> first (<span data-num="6" data-den="9" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">6 of 9</span>) · visit <span data-date="2026-10-28">Wed 28 Oct</span><span class="block text-[13.5px] font-normal text-[#6b7280]">then <span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-05</span>, <span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-06</span></span></p><div class="mt-1 flex flex-col gap-2.5"><a data-testid="wcard-listen" class="flex min-h-[48px] w-full items-center justify-center rounded-2xl px-4 text-[16px] font-semibold border border-[#d1d5db] bg-white text-[#1d2025]" href="/portal/coach/insights/w/W-IP-TIME#moment">Listen <span data-clock="">0:38</span></a><a data-testid="wcard-see" class="flex min-h-[48px] w-full items-center justify-center rounded-2xl px-4 text-[16px] font-semibold bg-[#33374a] text-white" href="/portal/coach/insights/w/W-IP-TIME">See the move</a></div></section></div><a data-testid="wrow" data-w="W-EXIT-NOPLAN" data-state="ranked" class="flex w-full items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white px-3.5 py-3 text-start" href="/portal/coach/insights/w/W-EXIT-NOPLAN"><span class="flex w-[64px] shrink-0 flex-col items-center leading-tight"><span data-num="12" data-den="47" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="text-center text-[15px] font-bold text-[#1d2025]">12 of 47</span><span data-nonum="" class="text-[10.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[#6b7280] rtl:tracking-normal">Move 2 of 2</span></span><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-0.5"><span class="text-[15.5px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1d2025]">Time left, no closing check</span><span class="text-[14px] leading-snug text-[#374151]">lessons whose plan asked for an exit check had time left and ended without one.</span><span class="text-[12.5px] leading-snug text-[#6b7280]"><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-05</span> first (<span data-num="4" data-den="10" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">4 of 10</span>) · <span data-window="w4-2026-09-28">28 Sep to 25 Oct</span> · lesson-plan fidelity</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="luc