le="border-color: rgb(79, 70, 229); background: transparent;"></span></span><span data-testid="step-chip" data-chip="worked" class="inline-flex min-h-[28px] items-center rounded-full px-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold bg-[#e8f6ee] text-[#1f7a4c]">It worked</span></div></li><li data-testid="step-row" data-step="00000000-0000-4000-8000-050000000007" class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 border-b border-[#f3f4f6] py-3 last:border-b-0"><p data-text="library" class="text-[15.5px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1d2025]">Read the plan's practice line aloud at minute 15, say the time, walk the rows for 8 minutes</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-snug text-[#6b7280] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">T-07</span> · <span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-03</span> · set <span data-date="2026-10-14">14 Oct</span> · check: visit <span data-date="2026-10-28">Wed 28 Oct</span></p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5"><span data-testid="step-strip" class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span data-dot="done" role="img" aria-label="done" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(79, 70, 229); background: rgb(79, 70, 229);"></span><span data-dot="partial" role="img" aria-label="partial" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(79, 70, 229); background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4f46e5 50%, transparent 50%);"></span><span data-dot="missing" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); background: transparent;"></span></span><span data-num="1" data-den="3" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="inline-flex min-h-[28px] items-center rounded-full px-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold bg-[#eef2ff] text-[#312e81]"><span data-testid="step-chip" data-chip="to_come">1 recording to come</span></span></div></li><li data-testid="step-row" data-step="00000000-0000-4000-8000-050000000013" class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 border-b border-[#f3f4f6] py-3 last:border-b-0"><p data-text="library" class="text-[15.5px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1d2025]">Ask the exit question at minute 22 and read five slates aloud, naming what was right</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-snug text-[#6b7280] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">T-19</span> · <span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-05</span> · set <span data-date="2026-10-20">20 Oct</span> · check: visit <span data-date="2026-11-03">Tue 3 Nov</span></p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5"><span data-testid="step-strip" class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span data-dot="missing" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); background: transparent;"></span><span data-dot="missing" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); background: transparent;"></span><span data-dot="missing" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); background: transparent;"></span></span><span data-num="3" data-den="3" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="inline-flex min-h-[28px] items-center rounded-full px-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold bg-[#eef2ff] text-[#312e81]"><span data-testid="step-chip" data-chip="to_come">3 recordings to come</span></span></div></li></ul><p data-testid="s1-steps-legend" class="pb-1.5 text-[12.5px] text-[#6b7280]">done · partial · not done</p></section><section data-testid="s1-not-yet" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-[#d1d5db] bg-[#f9fafb] px-4 py-3.5"><h2 class="text-[16