-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(79, 70, 229); background: rgb(79, 70, 229);"></span><span data-dot="not_done" role="img" aria-label="not done" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(79, 70, 229); background: transparent;"></span></span><span data-testid="step-chip" data-chip="worked" class="inline-flex min-h-[28px] items-center rounded-full px-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold bg-[#e8f6ee] text-[#1f7a4c]">It worked</span></div></li><li data-testid="step-row" data-step="00000000-0000-4000-8000-050000000007" class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 border-b border-[#f3f4f6] py-3 last:border-b-0"><p data-text="library" class="text-[15.5px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1d2025]">Read the plan's practice line aloud at minute 15, say the time, walk the rows for 8 minutes</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-snug text-[#6b7280] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">T-07</span> · <span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-03</span> · set <span data-date="2026-10-14">14 Oct</span> · check: visit <span data-date="2026-10-28">Wed 28 Oct</span></p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5"><span data-testid="step-strip" class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span data-dot="done" role="img" aria-label="done" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(79, 70, 229); background: rgb(79, 70, 229);"></span><span data-dot="partial" role="img" aria-label="partial" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(79, 70, 229); background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4f46e5 50%, transparent 50%);"></span><span data-dot="missing" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); background: transparent;"></span></span><span data-num="1" data-den="3" data-win="w4-2026-09-21" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="inline-flex min-h-[28px] items-center rounded-full px-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold bg-[#eef2ff] text-[#312e81]"><span data-testid="step-chip" data-chip="to_come">1 recording to come</span></span></div></li><li data-testid="step-row" data-step="00000000-0000-4000-8000-050000000013" class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 border-b border-[#f3f4f6] py-3 last:border-b-0"><p data-text="library" class="text-[15.5px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1d2025]">Ask the exit question at minute 22 and read five slates aloud, naming what was right</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-snug text-[#6b7280] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">T-19</span> · <span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-05</span> · set <span data-date="2026-10-20">20 Oct</span> · check: visit <span data-date="2026-11-03">Tue 3 Nov</span></p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5"><span data-testid="step-strip" class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span data-dot="missing" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); background: transparent;"></span><span data-dot="missing" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); background: transparent;"></span><span data-dot="missing" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); background: transparent;"></span></span><span data-num="3" data-den="3" data-win="w4-2026-09-21" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="inline-flex min-h-[28px] items-center rounded-full px-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold bg-[#eef2ff] text-[#312e81]"><span data-testid="step-chip" data-chip="to_come">3 recordings to come</span></span></div></li></ul><p data-testid="s1-steps-legend" class="pb-1.5 text-[12.5px] text-[#6b7280]">done · partial · not done</p></section><section data-testid="s1-not-yet" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-[#d1d5db] bg-[#f9fafb] px-4 py-3.5"><h2 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d2025]">Not yet</h2><p class="text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-[#6b7280]">These need more recordings before a card shows</p><div data-testid="wrow-not-yet" data-w="W-WARM" data-state="not_yet" class="flex w-full items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white px-3.5 py-3 text-start"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-0.5"><span class="text-[15.5px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1d2025]">Warm-up skipped</span><span class="text-[12.5px] leading-snug text-[#6b7280]"><span class="block"><span data-num="11" data-den="20" data-win="w4-2026-09-21" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">11 of 20</span> graded lessons · the card shows at <span data-nonum="">20</span></span><span data-num="2" data-den="3" data-win="w4-2026-09-21" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="block">seen in 2 of the 3 codes needed</span><span class="block"><span data-window="w4-2026-09-21">21 Sep to 18 Oct</span></span></span></span></div></section><section data-testid="s1-phonics" data-status="testing" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white px-4 py-3.5"><h2 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d2025]">Phonics check</h2><p data-nonum="" class="text-[14.5px] leading-snug text-[#374151]">Being tested against a human read of 30 reading hours. It starts when the two agree. 12 of 30 read.</p></section><a data-testid="s1-stats-link" class="flex min-h-[48px] w-full items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-[#d1d5db] bg-white px-4 text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d2025]" href="/portal/coach/insights/stats">Average stats and results ›</a></div><p data-testid="trust-line" class="px-1 pt-2 text-center text-[12.5px] text-[#6b7280]">Codes, never names. For coaching, never for evaluation.</p></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`S1 This week > ur > failed: renders, keeps the count contract, no identity 1`] = `"<div data-testid="layout"><div data-testid="insights-this-week" class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-xl flex-col text-[#1d2025]"><header class="flex flex-col gap-3 px-1 pb-1.5 pt-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><h1 class="min-w-0 flex-1 break-words text-[32px] font-light leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.015em] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">اس ہفتے</h1></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span data-testid="s1-today" class="inline-flex h-[30px] items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white px-3 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#4b5563]"><span data-date="2026-10-26">پیر ۲۶ اکتوبر</span></span></div></header><div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 pb-4 pt-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 pb-2"><div data-testid="s1-empty" data-status="failed"><div role="status" class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white px-4 py-3.5 text-[15px] leading-snug text-[#374151]"><p><span data-nonum="">تجزیہ سات دن سے نہیں چلا۔ آپ کے جاری قدم دکھائی دے رہے ہیں۔ اپنے آر ایم سے بات کریں۔</span></p><p data-window="w4-2026-09-28" class="mt-1.5 text-[12.5px] leading-snug text-[#6b7280]">۲۸ ستمبر تا ۲۵ اکتوبر، سبق کے منصوبے پر عمل، نمبر دینے کا طریقہ ۲۸ ستمبر کو بدلا</p></div></div><p data-num="11" data-den="17" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="px-1 text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-[#6b7280]">۱۷ ریکارڈنگز میں سے ۱۱ کے ساتھ منصوبہ جُڑا تھا۔</p><section data-testid="s1-steps" class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white px-4 pt-3.5 pb-2"><h2 class="text-[17px] font-semibold text-[#1d2025]">جاری قدم</h2><p class="text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-[#6b7280]">جو آپ نے طے کیے، اور اگلی تین ریکارڈنگز</p><ul class="flex flex-col"><li data-testid="step-row" data-step="00000000-0000-4000-8000-050000000321" class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 border-b border-[#f3f4f6] py-3 last:border-b-0"><p data-text="library" class="text-[15.5px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1d2025]">سبق سے پہلے ایک بچے کو وقت کا نگران بنائیں، تین نشان (۱۰، ۱۷، ۲۵) دیں؛ آواز پر مرحلہ بدلیں</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-snug text-[#6b7280] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><span data-code="" dir="ltr" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">⁦T-04⁩</span>، <span data-code="" dir="ltr" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">⁦Govt. Primary School Fictional-52⁩</span>، طے <span data-date="2026-10-19">۱۹ اکتوبر</span>، جانچ: دورہ <span data-date="2026-11-02">پیر ۲ نومبر</span></p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5"><span data-testid="step-strip" class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span data-dot="partial" role="img" aria-label="ادھورا" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(79, 70, 229); background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4f46e5 50%, transparent 50%);"></span><span data-dot="missing" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); background: transparent;"></span><span data-dot="missing" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-[18px] w-[18px] rounded-full border-2 rtl:-scale-x-100" style="border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); background: transparent;"></span></span><span data-num="2" data-den="3" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="inline-flex min-h-[28px] items-center rounded-full px-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold bg-[#eef2ff] text-[#312e81]"><span data-testid="step-chip" data-chip="to_come">۲ ریکارڈنگز باقی</span></span></div></li></ul><p data-testid="s1-steps-legend" class="pb-1.5 text-[12.5px] text-[#6b7280]">ہوا، ادھورا، نہیں ہوا</p></section><section data-testid="s1-phonics" data-status="testing" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white px-4 py-3.5"><h2 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d2025]">حروف کی آوازوں کی جانچ</h2><p data-nonum="" class="text-[14.5px] leading-snug text-[#374151]">۳۰ پڑھائی کے گھنٹوں پر ایک شخص کی سنی ہوئی جانچ سے ملائی جا رہی ہے۔ دونوں کے ملنے پر شروع ہو گی۔ ۳۰ میں سے ۱۲ سنے گئے۔</p></section><a data-testid="s1-stats-link" class="flex min-h-[48px] w-full items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-[#d1d5db] bg-white px-4 text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1d2025]" href="/portal/coach/insights/stats">اوسط اعداد اور نتائج</a></div><p data-testid="trust-line" class="px-1 pt-2 text-center text-[12.5px] text-[#6b7280]">کوڈ، نام نہیں۔ کوچنگ کے لیے، جانچ پڑتال کے لیے نہیں۔</p></div></div></div>"`;

